--- body ---
Add distinct global-library and active-document fieldsets, each with its own
labelled progress bar. Global progress is verified current packs divided by
supported non-trash attachments, retaining failures and missing sources in
the denominator. During census the global bar is indeterminate. Native fulltext
statistics remain separate and collapsible. Keep system theme colors.

Code-level panel review is recorded in `verification/SDT-SITTER-UI-PANEL.md`.
The source and real-Zotero integration tests live with ticket 0685's combined
delivery; no UI accessibility certification is claimed.
